/* Gp062 - ShapeFix_Edge.FixAddPCurve trimmed-surface boundary
 * Defect: edge on RECTANGULAR_TRIMMED_SURFACE near trim boundary; FixAddPCurve
 * constructs a pcurve that extends outside the trim window. */
